  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Sec. 2631(a), each individual has a GSTT exemption equal to the applicable exclusion amount under Sec. 2010(c). A dynasty trust allows the GSTT exemption to be allocated under Sec. 2632, sheltering both the original $5 million transfer and all future appreciation from GSTT for multiple generations. Trust growth compounds free of transfer tax permanently.
